{:edb/db-before-t 2831 :edb/db-after-t 2832 :edb/tx-data [[13194139536144 50 #inst "2026-10-09T16:49:37.185Z" 13194139536144 true] [17592186179662 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385918 13194139536144 true] [17592186179662 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385925 13194139536144 true] [17592186179662 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385932 13194139536144 true] [17592186179663 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385904 13194139536144 true] [17592186179663 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385911 13194139536144 true] [17592186385904 1017 #edb/ref 17592186385905 13194139536144 true] [17592186385904 1089 "q-124180" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385904 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536144 true] [17592186385904 1100 "If ${\\int }_{-{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=-1$ and ${\\int }_{-{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=4,$ calculate ${\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x$ given that $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}.$" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385904 1113 #uuid "3519d3b9-907f-5504-bc37-f57a71871ff7" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385904 1145 "Let $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}$ be a piecewise smooth path in the $xy$-plane, and let $-C$ be the curve consisting of the same points as $C$ but with the opposite orientation. \n\nFor line integrals with respect to $x,$ we have the following properties:\n\n- ${\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x$\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{-{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x-{\\int }_{-{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-(-1)-4 \\\\  & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385905 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385906 13194139536144 true] [17592186385905 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385907 13194139536144 true] [17592186385905 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385908 13194139536144 true] [17592186385905 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385909 13194139536144 true] [17592186385905 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385910 13194139536144 true] [17592186385905 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536144 true] [17592186385905 1041 "selection" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385905 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385909 13194139536144 true] [17592186385905 1110 #uuid "d1a1a5fe-1049-5994-acbc-2ba14abded63" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385906 1034 "Impossible to determine" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385906 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536144 true] [17592186385906 1111 #uuid "f108c379-a699-52ff-aa6a-dba39bdc9133" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385907 1034 "-5" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385907 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536144 true] [17592186385907 1111 #uuid "c9abf89e-9854-54bd-a770-baf94bf51389" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385908 1034 "3" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385908 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536144 true] [17592186385908 1111 #uuid "55592abc-a217-5520-bd36-3727bcde50a9" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385909 1034 "-3" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385909 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536144 true] [17592186385909 1111 #uuid "ee8fa55c-709a-545b-aed4-11d72f6793e7" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385910 1034 "5" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385910 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536144 true] [17592186385910 1111 #uuid "fdbc1140-0aab-5f33-8213-cc97a2d4978e" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385911 1017 #edb/ref 17592186385912 13194139536144 true] [17592186385911 1089 "q-124185" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385911 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536144 true] [17592186385911 1100 "If ${\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y=9$ and ${\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y=-3,$ calculate ${\\int }_{-{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y$ given that $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}.$" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385911 1113 #uuid "1c96b0a9-7e9f-5669-8863-2dd6417e54b1" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385911 1145 "Let $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}$ be a piecewise smooth path in the $xy$-plane, and let $-C$ be the curve consisting of the same points as $C$ but with the opposite orientation. \n\nFor line integrals with respect to $y,$ we have the following properties:\n\n- ${\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y=-{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y$\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y$\n\nIn our case, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\ -{\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y & =-3-{\\int }_{-{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\ -9 & =-3-{\\int }_{-{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\ -6 & =-{\\int }_{-{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y=6.\n$$" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385913 13194139536144 true] [17592186385912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385914 13194139536144 true] [17592186385912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385915 13194139536144 true] [17592186385912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385916 13194139536144 true] [17592186385912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385917 13194139536144 true] [17592186385912 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536144 true] [17592186385912 1041 "selection" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385912 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385915 13194139536144 true] [17592186385912 1110 #uuid "3f607e77-9041-5e10-b2c5-c227273fa4b5" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385913 1034 "12" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385913 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536144 true] [17592186385913 1111 #uuid "27d3c5ba-fdb0-575b-ae6e-b37f0f6949e7" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385914 1034 "10" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385914 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536144 true] [17592186385914 1111 #uuid "85646987-4de4-579c-87de-6b3fe028fea9" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385915 1034 "6" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385915 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536144 true] [17592186385915 1111 #uuid "84d2556d-41dc-5400-8636-fd2ce4b81424" 13194139536144 true] [17592186385916 1034 "-12" 131941395361